# Base URL of the self-hosted OMR (Optical Music Recognition) service, used only for
# PDF/image sheet-music imports. Leave unset to disable PDF/image import (MusicXML and
# MIDI import work fully without this). See ../services/omr-service/README.md to build
# and run the service, including the Audiveris AGPL-3.0 licensing note.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the real value - .env.local is gitignored.
VITE_OMR_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
